    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="13.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 13.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ lóchwá ðone fleman féde oððe feormie, gylde fif pund ðam cýnge, butan he hine geladige þæt he hine flema nyste.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And whoever feeds or harbours the fugitive shall pay £5 to the king, unless he clear himself by a declaration that he did not know that he was a fugitive.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And lochwa þone flyman fede oððe feormie, gylde V pund þam cingce, butan he hine geladige, þæt he hine fleame nyste.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
